OL,3,GNEWSAMum of four says pipe bomb attack
OL,4,Awas case of 'mistaken identity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother of four whose north Belfast
OL,7,Fhome was pipe-bombed has said the
OL,8,Fattack was a case of mistaken identity.
OL,10,FNicola Nugent said the device was put
OL,11,Fthrough the letterbox of her home on
OL,12,FStanhope Street at about 03:00 BST on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FPolice said it "exploded fully",
OL,16,Fsetting off the fire alarm and causing
OL,17,Fdamage to the front door and the
OL,18,Fhallway.
OL,20,FNugent and her four children escaped
OL,21,Ffrom their home and no-one was injured.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
